# GitHub OAuth App credentials, used by app/api/auth and app/api/callback
# to authenticate editors into the Decap CMS admin panel at /admin.
#
# Create the OAuth App at https://github.com/settings/developers ->
# "New OAuth App":
#   Homepage URL            = your deployed site's origin
#   Authorization callback URL = <that origin>/api/callback
#
# Then copy this file to .env.local (for local dev) and fill these in, and
# add the same two values in Vercel's Project Settings -> Environment
# Variables for production.
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
